## Advanced Features & Configuration

### Custom Commands

#### Development Workflow
- **`/check-pr`** - Complete PR pipeline: lint → typecheck → test → security review → refactor → commit → create PR
- **`/quick-fix`** - Quick fix: lint + commit + push (skips tests)
- **`/feature-start [name]`** - Start feature: create branch from updated base
- **`/feature-complete`** - Complete feature: full checks, squash commits, create PR

#### Analysis & Testing
- **`/test-watch [pattern]`** - Vitest in watch mode with coverage
- **`/deps-check`** - Dependency analysis: outdated, audit, unused imports
- **`/perf-check`** - Performance analysis: build time, bundle size
- **`/stow-sync`** - Synchronize dotfiles with GNU Stow

### Automatic Hooks

#### Active Hooks
- **PostToolUse**: `log-commands` - Logs bash commands to `~/.claude/command-history.log`
- **PreToolUse**: `validate-imports` - Enforces import standards (blocks `require()`, `any` type, etc.)
- **UserPromptSubmit**: `context-enhancer` - Adds git context and branch warnings

### Specialized Subagents

